{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Z Virus has turned the world into a living nightmare. Cities lie in ruins, streets are crawling with the undead, and the last survivors are hiding in fear, praying for a miracle. Humanity is on the brink of extinction\u2026 and the final hope rests on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/3f6107f997faed9e9300ad3f85cff575.poster.avif?t=1756711982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/3f6107f997faed9e9300ad3f85cff575.webm?t=1756711982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/3f6107f997faed9e9300ad3f85cff575.mp4?t=1756711982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the lone fighter who dares to stand against the endless zombie swarms. But survival alone is not enough. Scattered across the land are the fragments of a powerful antidote \u2014 the only cure that can stop the Z Virus and save the remnants of humankind. To claim them, you\u2019ll have to carve your way through hordes of the infected, face terrifying bosses, and make life-or-death decisions on a board-game style map where every step matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/aef12c8167739efc9b147d86b3944988.poster.avif?t=1756711982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/aef12c8167739efc9b147d86b3944988.webm?t=1756711982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/aef12c8167739efc9b147d86b3944988.mp4?t=1756711982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Z Meat</strong> is a fast-paced zombie shooter with arcade-style action, tactical map progression, and a clear goal: collect all pieces of the cure and end the apocalypse once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/84a73d25492638768c3cca41daafa085.avif?t=1756711982\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you take the safer path to survive a little longer, or risk everything for greater rewards? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/ed10f9d8a970b0fa23a29c132d6b51be.avif?t=1756711982\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival</strong> \u2013 face endless waves of zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sniper Challenge</strong> \u2013 every bullet counts in high-pressure precision shooting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 take down monstrous abominations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense Missions</strong> \u2013 protect the \u201cbarrel\u201d from relentless swarms.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Board-game style progression</strong> \u2013 choose your path across a branching map and hunt down every piece of the cure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Fast-paced arcade action</strong> \u2013 non-stop zombie blasting with escalating difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>9 unique weapons</strong> \u2013 each upgradable for even more destructive power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca3 <strong>Power-ups and abilities</strong> \u2013 supercharge your arsenal and turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Reactive zombie hordes</strong> \u2013 enemies adapt and grow more aggressive the longer you last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized visuals</strong> \u2013 cartoon-inspired graphics with smooth animations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. Upgrade. Collect the cure. <br>Do you have what it takes to stop the Z Virus once and for all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/92d530863afcc617a7d815bbaf930318.avif?t=1756711982\" width=800 height=370 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3989010?t=1756711982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/aff16f3e315f0e71fe7d3b38480cfb06cee6a0c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756711982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/19b07cfaa240a2a334fc4d94fe605115d27a224a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756711982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/19b07cfaa240a2a334fc4d94fe605115d27a224a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756711982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"